l_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1ac2d5b4/uploads/origins/99b35381-562a-4247-898c-683e4595c360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28eefbcb54fc87941824ac6bfe02f06e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1ac2d5b4/uploads/origins/99b35381-562a-4247-898c-683e4595c360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=28eefbcb54fc87941824ac6bfe02f06e, https://si.imgix.net/1ac2d5b4/uploads/origins/99b35381-562a-4247-898c-683e4595c360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a85d1ce4a21c7c95dacb59bacebd02ec 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1ac2d5b4/uploads/origins/99b35381-562a-4247-898c-683e4595c360?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1f6625c157515435c1cc2b9840e5dc95 3x"}, "body": "Hello, kyo! I've been a fan of your art for a long time, so I'm pretty excited to see that you're using skeb!\n\nI was wondering if you would draw my OC Yomiko. She's a foxgirl with green eyes, black hair & fur (sometimes with red or purple highlights), and either one or four tails. Her favorite colors are red and gold, and she likes accessories like flowers and earrings. She usually has a mysterious or playful attitude. She can also appear as either a human with fox ears and a tail, or as a full furry/kemono character.\n\nI'll include a link to some reference images, but feel free to use your imagination and draw her however you like, I like being surprised! Thank you!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/yomiko-Aw0b8NN", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kyotyanehh/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 14979, "client_id": 2191796, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=736b891e7d3cf1b19249540c7e0f0a99", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=736b891e7d3cf1b19249540c7e0f0a99, https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3e7d19a3e9b52ad8fdcca81fa4539d1c 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8fbc2b5b5a957a56618abe8c705f60b9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a4e38d0571cf5844535b745b6c61ed66", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a4e38d0571cf5844535b745b6c61ed66, https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=38456b899f5d7e81b7f5f6ccf221e101 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2c943cd8/uploads/origins/ceac896a-fbbf-431b-a9bc-66aba936bdb8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=857e6037573181336bd543d8fa0c2b4b 3x"}, "body": "Hello! Your art is really good! I was wondering if you would be willing to draw my ghost girl character. \n\u30fc\n\u25e6While she lived, she was a woman who reached the depths of spatial and temporal magics with her studies. However, her studies led her to knowledge no one should know. As a result, she lost her life. Her spirit was eventually resurrected by a druid, though her memory of her life was fractured. She now usually spends her days holed up in her manor's library, but occasionally ventures out.\n\u25e6Even as a spirit, she experiences any range of expressions, though typically mild.\n\u25e6Motifs associated with her are locked doors, keys, books, sunflowers, and the concept of time (clockwork, hourglasses, etc.). \n\u30fc\nIf no instruction is okay, please compose it however you find most compelling. The setting is fantasy, but you're free to take whatever liberties you would like (I see FFXIV mentioned in your bio; similar sort of setting). Please use her formal outfit. Thank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/17xWEFl-w9HKRJF62A4MiA3ICmoefju_g?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kyotyanehh/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 14979, "client_id": 1228623, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a20992c677b144314923385e93978b5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3a20992c677b144314923385e93978b5, https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5162e4ea5760ce538db76b1fa6d56a6b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2244fa48c16ea948c56bce697dee467b 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=23b283ba483d4227da05461745e175ba", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=23b283ba483d4227da05461745e175ba, https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4968e3650b1696ccb55f8ba2b31c830f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2bc4ff6b/uploads/origins/31b380ae-9ed8-4a83-a4f2-86a5afab194e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4265dfc3cb4aa0744443fcfc81720052 3x"}, "body": "Your artwork is so lovely! I want to make a request for my oc if possible.  \n\nPlease draw him in this reference: https://toyhou.se/147894.ren-aspen   \n\nAdditional art: https://toyhou.se/147894.ren-aspen/5706489.art?key=ptuuYsvr3YfeWvn  \n\nRen: \u2642 . 180 cm. Fluffy white hair and sapphire eyes. Has a beautiful appearance that appeals to both genders. A kind boy who is very sick, his heart is weak. His themes are blue roses, owls, books, and magic.  \n\nRen uses magic to grow blue roses. The petals from the roses are used to brew tea that heals people. Can you draw an illustration with that theme? Feel free to draw my oc in any kinds of poses. I leave the composition up to you.  \n\nThank you for considering and wish you a nice day!", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kyotyanehh/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 14979, "client_id": 1659096, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=440fe0b857b458136e84c32259a72a16", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=440fe0b857b458136e84c32259a72a16, https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=729b189ae4e4d5c7cde3b64530e5b39a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6bdc083b9f39eb4203d162f45eca98f4 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08d5f17e5bd3f5784aebd6d8a3adfccd", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08d5f17e5bd3f5784aebd6d8a3adfccd, https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=59887d37079ba6be9c928fdefcbef78b 2x, https://si.imgix.net/393928a6/uploads/origins/5a502e72-1010-4a2c-92d8-c55792995aca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4e910a407435df57aee0e02af667940b 3x"}, "body": "Hi kyo, I found you through your latest skeb and fell in love with your art!\nCould I request my VTuber character?\n\nMy character's main design is based on Chinese hanfu with black goldfish motifs.\nPersonality is calm, grounded and responsible, often taking care of others. Wistful/melancholic atmosphere.\n\nPlease choose whichever outfit you like! (There are a lot of alternate outfits in the other outfits folder)\nWould be great to see whatever situation you think would fit the outfit!\nIf you need any ideas for what to draw:\n- wisteria\n- lantern festival (Chinese lanterns floating on water + into the sky)\n- reflection in water\n\nIf possible, I'd prefer to have the character separated from the background, but it's also fine if it's not!\n\nI'd like to use the illust on social media and possibly in a future cover and/or streams.\n\nThank you for the consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/10rVTX7cY9urPa4hCLAtDR4tJ55PZnors?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kyotyanehh/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 14979, "client_id": 946151, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91e46150fc89fc1aa8b4e3d83dc4e474", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=91e46150fc89fc1aa8b4e3d83dc4e474, https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4852338d735f59fe1f73841a658bfee7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6c598d9b5c6f539ba41fb788d969a02d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b6c9ff77acac52d7b430d28c620cb57b", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b6c9ff77acac52d7b430d28c620cb57b, https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=48cf7bb68429ebd441b0861df278d5dc 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a6d45ff8/uploads/origins/2e7e6030-78b8-4dfb-95c1-b9102cb180c5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=04b49bdad5f23aff762d0bacb1b14254 3x"}, "body": "Thank you for considering my request!\n\nI stream TRPGs on Twitch and have followed your work forever! I'd love to get a picture for the end of the game of our party to show the audience with credit!\n\nFirst Ridill: https://imgur.com/a/V2nvu4e\nShe's an ethereal sage! She's 5' 8''. She has a horn! She's kind and sad but hides by smiling! She loves her friends!\n\nAce: https://imgur.com/a/HYx93me\nHe's a martial artist and mech pilot! He is a tough, impulsive and unstable. He is 6' 2'' his mech: https://imgur.com/a/YuzdUKR\n\nWillow: https://imgur.com/a/p7eKdRA\nShe is a short 5' 2'' brave hero! She a fist fighter and is optimistic and determined!\n\nArg0s: https://imgur.com/a/WKZ3Tmk\nHe is the cool tactician! He's 6' 4'' and is smart and calm\n\nBasil: https://imgur.com/a/QPeoNGC\nShe's 5' 4'' and is very sweet! She has a dinosaur tail!\n\nThey are from a neon sci-fi city at the end of the world in a blizzard. The world is based in flame and frost!\n\nDraw freely! Any setting or pose!\n\nThank you so much!", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kyotyanehh/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 14979, "client_id": 702682, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/96cf7232/uploads/origins/54c8b8de-c96b-4b0c-8bbe-869377d7548f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop